59" end="32.418">た</span><span begin="32.418" end="32.636">つ</span><span begin="32.636" end="32.837">ま</span><span begin="32.837" end="33.204">先</span><span begin="33.204" end="33.570">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">踮起脚尖渴望着最后的机会</span></p><p begin="33.580" end="36.745" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.580" end="34.144">踊</span><span begin="34.144" end="34.318">り</span><span begin="34.318" end="34.456">出</span><span begin="34.456" end="34.633">す</span><span begin="34.633" end="34.822">ま</span><span begin="34.822" end="35.102">ま</span><span begin="35.102" end="35.315">駆</span><span begin="35.315" end="35.474">け</span><span begin="35.474" end="35.639">た</span><span begin="35.639" end="35.828">こ</span><span begin="35.828" end="36.013">の</span><span begin="36.013" end="36.286">夜</span><span begin="36.286" end="36.745">空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">踏出舞步纵情奔向这个夜空</span></p><p begin="36.755" end="39.463" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.755" end="37.304">並</span><span begin="37.304" end="37.455">の</span><span begin="37.455" end="37.563">ス</span><span begin="37.563" end="37.719">タ</span><span begin="37.719" end="37.884">ン</span><span begin="37.884" end="38.069">ス</span><span begin="38.069" end="38.141">じ</span><span begin="38.141" end="38.261">ゃ</span><span begin="38.261" end="38.710">靡</span><span begin="38.710" end="38.914">か</span><span begin="38.914" end="39.075">な</span><span begin="39.075" end="39.463">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">平凡的姿态无法折服他人</span></p><p begin="39.531" end="43.047" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.531" end="39.897">星</span><span begin="39.897" end="40.320">は</span><span begin="40.320" end="40.713">宝</span><span begin="40.713" end="41.117">石</span><span begin="41.117" end="41.328">の</span><span begin="41.328" end="42.111">憧</span><span begin="42.111" end="43.047">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星辰是宝石们的憧憬</span><