<p begin="52.368" end="55.749" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.368" end="52.479">い</span><span begin="52.479" end="52.668">つ</span><span begin="52.668" end="52.923">い</span><span begin="52.923" end="53.058">つ</span><span begin="53.058" end="53.254">ま</span><span begin="53.254" end="53.463">で</span><span begin="53.463" end="53.931">も</span><span begin="54.138" end="54.889">憧</span><span begin="54.889" end="55.749">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时时刻刻永远心怀憧憬</span></p><p begin="56.129" end="58.273" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.129" end="56.321">焦</span><span begin="56.321" end="56.535">が</span><span begin="56.535" end="56.679">れ</span><span begin="56.679" end="56.935">て</span><span begin="56.935" end="57.118">い</span><span begin="57.118" end="57.293">る</span><span begin="57.293" end="58.273">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论何时都想要重新踏上</span></p><p begin="57.369" end="1:00.465" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.369" end="57.708">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="57.708" end="58.201">never</span> <span begin="58.201" end="59.041">seen</span> <span begin="59.041" end="59.242">such</span> <span begin="59.242" end="59.456">a</span> <span begin="59.456" end="1:00.465">liar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我从未见过这样的骗子</span></p><p begin="1:00.475" end="1:04.014" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.475" end="1:00.691">生</span><span begin="1:00.691" end="1:00.872">ま</span><span begin="1:00.872" end="1:01.039">れ</span><span begin="1:01.039" end="1:01.256">つ</span><span begin="1:01.256" end="1:01.463">き</span><span begin="1:01.463" end="1:01.609">た</span><span begin="1:01.609" end="1:01.861">っ</span><span begin="1:01.861" end="1:02.098">て</span><span begin="1:02.098" end="1:02.266">の</span><span begin="1:02.266" end="1:03.108">底</span><span begin="1:03.108" end="1:03.508">な</span><span begin="1:03.508" end="1:04.014">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" x